{"2408670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "April '86", "steam_appid": 2408670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Subscribe now and get notified first when the game is released!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408670/extras/5d8de9a586ae74edca8c7cdf2e1a1356.poster.avif?t=1781647028\" width=668 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408670/extras/5d8de9a586ae74edca8c7cdf2e1a1356.webm?t=1781647028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408670/extras/5d8de9a586ae74edca8c7cdf2e1a1356.mp4?t=1781647028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sergey grew up in Pripyat.<br>In 1986, just a few weeks before the Chernobyl Nuclear Power Plant disaster, children began to disappear without a trace. Among them was his younger sister, Varya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the catastrophe, the city was abandoned. The searches stopped, and the past was buried beneath radiation and deadly silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten years later, Sergey receives an anonymous envelope.<br>Inside is a photograph of Varya, taken <i>after</i> the disaster, against the backdrop of the dead city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the truth, he must return to a place no one was meant to return to — the abandoned city of Pripyat, where memories awaken and secrets refuse to remain forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408670/extras/47f96fd435d14f02b0cdc1a4d4acb010.poster.avif?t=1781647028\" width=670 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408670/extras/47f96fd435d14f02b0cdc1a4d4acb010.webm?t=1781647028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408670/extras/47f96fd435d14f02b0cdc1a4d4acb010.mp4?t=1781647028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the abandoned city of Pripyat, recreated from real locations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the 1980s USSR: interiors, objects, and everyday details;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story rooted in mysticism, tragedy, and the disappearance of children;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transitions between reality and a distorted world of memories;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for artifacts and clues that reveal the events of 1986;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival shooter elements: rare and tense encounters with hostile creatures;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use melee and firearms as a means of survival;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-paced gameplay with puzzles inspired by classic adventure games;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An oppressive atmosphere, unsettling sound design, and rare but memorable scares;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distinctive visual style inspired by iconic psychological horror titles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408670/extras/80d8a8bb2f0b8c6a341662f9deef1f6f.poster.avif?t=1781647028\" width=670 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408670/extras/80d8a8bb2f0b8c6a341662f9deef1f6f.webm?t=1781647028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408670/extras/80d8a8bb2f0b8c6a341662f9deef1f6f.mp4?t=1781647028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>April ’86 is not a story about monsters, but about memory, guilt, and what never truly stayed in the past.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you appreciate atmospheric horror with slow storytelling and a constant sense of unease, this journey is worth seeing through to the end.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Subscribe now and get notified first when the game is released!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408670/extras/5d8de9a586ae74edca8c7cdf2e1a1356.poster.avif?t=1781647028\" width=668 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408670/extras/5d8de9a586ae74edca8c7cdf2e1a1356.webm?t=1781647028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408670/extras/5d8de9a586ae74edca8c7cdf2e1a1356.mp4?t=1781647028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sergey grew up in Pripyat.<br>In 1986, just a few weeks before the Chernobyl Nuclear Power Plant disaster, children began to disappear without a trace. Among them was his younger sister, Varya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the catastrophe, the city was abandoned. The searches stopped, and the past was buried beneath radiation and deadly silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten years later, Sergey receives an anonymous envelope.<b